, and an urgent matter forced me to leave the hotel prematurely. It is a true regret that I could not be formally introduced to you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_145","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_145","I won't charge a dime for my services. In exchange, though—",0,""],["se","se_226"],["ctl","avg1_145","a","006",null,null,-0.35,1.5,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_145","Keep my free bodyguard gig a secret from everyone beyond you and the New Star Guild.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_145","a","005","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_145","If word gets out that a Goodwind manager is working pro bono, it'll ruin our business model.==W== Consider yourself a very special exception.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_145","a","003","music",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Understood. My lips are sealed.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_145","a","004","shy",null,0.0,1.0,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_145","Hehe. It's quite an honor to meet the famous CEO of Boss Accord.",0,""],["se","se_146"],["ctl","avg1_145","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_145","I've heard quite a few ... fascinating stories about you, after all.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","Whatever you've heard... Thank you for taking the commission.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","The job is simple: keep me in one piece until the banquet ends...==W== My safety is in your hands.",1,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["mrt",0,"z","012",null,"JuGong2"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_145","a","005","love",null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_145","Thank you for the trust. Here's to a mutually beneficial partnership.",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",1.0],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_109"],["bg","tan